#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:3
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:9
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/home.html:110
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/project_detail.html:73
#: templates/base.html:34 templates/base.html:60 templates/base.html:101
msgid "How to contribute"
msgstr "कसरी योगदान गर्ने"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:8
msgid "About · How to contribute"
msgstr "बारेमा · कसरी योगदान गर्ने"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:10
msgid ""
"A practical path from finding public-interest work to leaving a visible "
"record of what changed. DevNepal is the registry and collaboration layer; "
"code stays on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"सार्वजनिक हितको काम भेट्टाएदेखि के परिवर्तन भयो भन्ने देखिने अभिलेख राख्नेसम्मको व्यावहारिक "
"बाटो।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:11
msgid ""
"Find a fit · Read before acting · Close the loop through the project’s "
"published route."
msgstr ""
"उपयुक्तता खोज्नुहोस् · कार्य गर्नुअघि पढ्नुहोस् · परियोजनाको प्रकाशित मार्गबाट प्रक्रिया "
"पूरा गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:15
msgid "01 · The process"
msgstr "०१ · प्रक्रिया"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:17
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:18
msgid "Contribution steps"
msgstr "योगदानका चरणहरू"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:19
msgid "A ministry lists a project"
msgstr "मन्त्रालयले परियोजना सूचीबद्ध गर्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:19
msgid ""
"A named publisher documents the contribution route, public safeguards, and "
"maintainer responsibility before publication."
msgstr ""
"प्रकाशनअघि नामित प्रकाशकले योगदान मार्ग, सार्वजनिक सुरक्षा उपाय र मर्मतकर्ताको "
"जिम्मेवारी दस्तावेज गर्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:20
msgid "PMO approves"
msgstr "PMO ले स्वीकृत गर्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:20
msgid ""
"Only approved government listings carry the Official badge; the decision is "
"attributable and recorded."
msgstr ""
"स्वीकृत सरकारी सूचीकरणले मात्र आधिकारिक बैज पाउँछन्; निर्णयको जिम्मेवारी स्पष्ट र अभिलेखित "
"हुन्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:21
msgid "You contribute"
msgstr "तपाईं योगदान गर्नुहुन्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:21
msgid ""
"Apply when a workstream is controlled, or follow the published direct-"
"contribution instructions for an open task."
msgstr ""
"कार्यधारा नियन्त्रित भएमा आवेदन दिनुहोस्, वा प्रकाशित प्रत्यक्ष-योगदान निर्देशन पालना "
"गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:22
msgid "Work is verified and recognised"
msgstr "काम प्रमाणित र मान्यता प्राप्त हुन्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:22
msgid ""
"A maintainer reviews the evidence and records a reasoned decision; raw "
"activity alone is not recognition."
msgstr ""
"मेन्टेनर वा अधिकृत समीक्षकले प्रमाण जाँचेर कारणसहित निर्णय अभिलेख गर्छ। आफैं बुझाएको दाबी "
"मात्र आधिकारिक सम्मान हुँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:28
msgid "02 · What DevNepal is — and is not"
msgstr "०२ · DevNepal के हो — र के होइन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:32
msgid "What DevNepal verifies"
msgstr "देवनेपालले के प्रमाणित गर्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:34
msgid ""
"Government projects have an accountable ministry publisher, maintainer, "
"suitability review, and contribution guidance before publication."
msgstr ""
"सरकारी परियोजनामा प्रकाशनअघि जवाफदेही मन्त्रालय प्रकाशक, मेन्टेनर, उपयुक्तता समीक्षा र "
"योगदान निर्देशन हुन्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:35
msgid ""
"Community projects identify their owner, terms, repository, and route for "
"questions before they open for collaboration."
msgstr ""
"समुदाय परियोजनाले सहकार्य खोल्नुअघि आफ्नो मालिक, सर्त, रिपोजिटरी र प्रश्न सोध्ने माध्यम "
"स्पष्ट गर्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:36
msgid ""
"Accepted contributions retain a visible evidence and decision trail; raw "
"activity is not treated as impact by itself."
msgstr ""
"स्वीकृत योगदानले देखिने प्रमाण र निर्णय अभिलेख राख्छ; कच्चा गतिविधिलाई मात्र प्रभाव "
"मानिँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:40
msgid "What DevNepal does not promise"
msgstr "देवनेपालले के प्रतिज्ञा गर्दैन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:42
msgid ""
"A listing is not an employment offer, procurement commitment, or guarantee "
"that a contribution will be merged."
msgstr "सूचीकरण रोजगारी प्रस्ताव, खरिद प्रतिबद्धता वा योगदान मर्ज हुने ग्यारेन्टी होइन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:43
msgid ""
"DevNepal is not a code host; branches, issues, pull requests, and CI remain "
"with the project’s repository."
msgstr ""
"DevNepal कोड होस्ट होइन; शाखा, इशु, पुल रिक्वेस्ट र CI परियोजनाको रिपोजिटरीमै रहन्छन्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:44
msgid ""
"Community projects are not government endorsements simply because they are "
"listed here."
msgstr "यहाँ सूचीबद्ध हुँदैमा समुदाय परियोजना सरकारी समर्थन पाएको हुँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:52
msgid "03 · Policies"
msgstr "०३ · नीतिहरू"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:54
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/project_detail.html:198
msgid "Security and reporting"
msgstr "सुरक्षा र प्रतिवेदन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:54
msgid "Confidential route available"
msgstr "गोप्य मार्ग उपलब्ध छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:56
msgid "Safety and reporting"
msgstr "सुरक्षा र रिपोर्टिङ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:57
msgid ""
"Follow the community code of conduct, keep private or security-sensitive "
"details out of public project pages, and use the confidential report form "
"when something needs review."
msgstr ""
