#: apps/projects/views.py:239
msgid ""
"DevNepal is a public-service collaboration space. Participation must remain "
"respectful, specific, and safe for contributors and government staff."
msgstr "DevNepal सार्वजनिक सेवाका लागि सहकार्य गर्ने मञ्च हो। सहभागिता योगदानकर्ता र सरकारी कर्मचारीका लागि सम्मानजनक, स्पष्ट र सुरक्षित रहनुपर्छ।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:244
#| msgid "Expected outcome"
msgid "Expected conduct"
msgstr "अपेक्षित परिणाम"

#: apps/projects/views.py:246
msgid ""
"Discuss the work, not the person. Respect privacy, accessibility needs, "
"language choice, and the published contribution process."
msgstr "व्यक्तिको होइन, कामको विषयमा छलफल गर्नुहोस्। गोपनीयता, पहुँचयोग्यताका आवश्यकता, भाषाको छनोट र प्रकाशित योगदान प्रक्रियाको सम्मान गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:251
msgid "Unacceptable conduct"
msgstr "अस्वीकार्य आचरण"

#: apps/projects/views.py:253
msgid ""
"Harassment, discrimination, threats, doxxing, credential sharing, and "
"publishing personal or restricted government data are prohibited."
msgstr "उत्पीडन, भेदभाव, धम्की, डक्सिङ, प्रमाणपत्र साझा गर्नु र व्यक्तिगत वा प्रतिबन्धित सरकारी डाटा प्रकाशित गर्नु निषेधित छ।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:258
#| msgid "Report content"
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "सामग्री रिपोर्ट गर्नुहोस्"

#: apps/projects/views.py:260
msgid ""
"Reports are handled privately, recorded as cases, and reviewed with a "
"reasoned, appealable decision."
msgstr "रिपोर्ट गोप्य रूपमा सम्हालिन्छन्, मुद्दाका रूपमा अभिलेख हुन्छन् र कारणसहित अपिल गर्न मिल्ने निर्णयद्वारा समीक्षा गरिन्छन्।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:275 templates/base.html:108
#| msgid "Private"
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "निजी"

#: apps/projects/views.py:276
msgid "Your data stays under your control"
