#: apps/projects/views.py:278
msgid ""
"Public profiles, leaderboard participation, and connected GitHub access are "
"separate choices. DevNepal does not make private profile fields public."
msgstr "सार्वजनिक प्रोफाइल, लिडरबोर्ड सहभागिता र जडान गरिएको GitHub पहुँच अलग-अलग विकल्प हुन्। DevNepal ले निजी प्रोफाइल फिल्ड सार्वजनिक बनाउँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:283
#| msgid "Public member profiles"
