msgstr "संस्करण %(version)s"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
msgid ""
"Only contributions accepted by an authorized maintainer receive points. "
"Scores remain pinned to this policy version for auditability."
msgstr ""
"अधिकृत मर्मतकर्ताले स्वीकार गरेका योगदानले मात्र अङ्क पाउँछन्। लेखापरीक्षणका लागि स्कोर यस "
"नीति संस्करणमै स्थिर रहन्छन्।"

