msgid "Rule"
msgstr "नियम"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
msgid "Open policy document"
msgstr "नीति दस्तावेज खोल्नुहोस्"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
#| msgid "What reviewers need"
msgid "What is excluded"
msgstr "समीक्षकलाई के चाहिन्छ"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
msgid ""
"No personal activity or private repository data is used. Raw commits, bots, "
"and duplicate events do not receive direct credit."
msgstr "कुनै व्यक्तिगत गतिविधि वा निजी रिपोजिटरी डाटा प्रयोग हुँदैन। कच्चा कमिट, बट र दोहोरिएका घटनाले प्रत्यक्ष श्रेय पाउँदैनन्।"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
#| msgid "Named accountability"
msgid "Correction and accountability"
msgstr "नामाङ्कित जवाफदेहिता"

#: apps/recognition/templates/recognition/public_policy.html:8
msgid ""
"Recognition corrections preserve an audit reason. Changing a policy does not "
"silently rewrite historical scores."
msgstr "पहिचान सच्याउँदा लेखापरीक्षण कारण सुरक्षित रहन्छ। नीति परिवर्तनले ऐतिहासिक स्कोर मौन रूपमा पुनर्लेखन गर्दैन।"

